{"parentUuid":"dc9ce54a-52b8-4e75-871c-3535689b1241","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0b2b79d4-d07b-41f7-92e8-67332e23d4ce","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PKAZ9zRYLNfKNFpTBReVdV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Bally The Shadow pinball manual pdf 16-50032-101\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Page 140 - The Shadow\",\"url\":\"https://www.planetarypinball.com/reference/gamemanuals/The_Shadow/files/assets/basic-html/page140.html\"},{\"title\":\"the shadow pinball machine\",\"url\":\"https://vintagearcade.net/shop/pinball-games/the-shadow-pinball-machine/\"},{\"title\":\"Page 33 - The Shadow\",\"url\":\"https://planetarypinball.com/reference/gamemanuals/The_Shadow/files/assets/basic-html/page33.html\"},{\"title\":\"ADDAMS GOLD (Bally) Manual operations\",\"url\":\"https://www.marcospecialties.com:443/pinball-parts/16-50038-101\"},{\"title\":\"(Topic ID: 93267)\",\"url\":\"https://pinside.com/pinball/forum/topic/shadow-manual-pdf\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow Pinball Manual - Bally - 1994-\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.de/itm/126990145325\"},{\"title\":\"Page 1 - BallyMidway GREY Parts Catalog 16-9562-A\",\"url\":\"https://planetarypinball.com/reference/partsmanuals/WMS_Parts_Grey_16-9562-A/files/assets/seo/page1.html\"},{\"title\":\"Bally THE GAME SHOW Original Flipper Handbuch mit Schaltplänen Bedienhandbuch-\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.de/itm/267021069057\"},{\"title\":\"SCARED STIFF (Bally) Manual - Original\",\"url\":\"https://www.marcospecialties.com/pinball-parts/16-50048-101\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow Pinball Machine\",\"url\":\"https://www.vintagearcade.net/?p=9552\"},{\"title\":\"Page 3 - BallyMidway GREY Parts Catalog 16-9562-A\",\"url\":\"https://planetarypinball.com/reference/partsmanuals/WMS_Parts_Grey_16-9562-A/files/assets/seo/page3.html\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow (Bally, 1994) VP9\",\"url\":\"https://pinballnirvana.com/forums/resources/the-shadow-bally-1994-vp9.2696/\"},{\"title\":\"THE GAME SHOW - Pinball Manual - BALLY - OEM Original - Coin Op-\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.de/itm/146278186377\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow\",\"url\":\"https://pinpedia.com/machine/The-Shadow\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow (pinball)\",\"url\":\"https://wiki.krisyotam.com/content/wikipedia_en_all_nopic_2026-03/The_Shadow_(pinball)\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow (Flipper) (e)\",\"url\":\"https://mogelpower.de/cheats/loesung.php?id=7066\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow\",\"url\":\"https://pinside.com/pinball/machine/shadow/details\"},{\"title\":\"# The Shadow\",\"url\":\"https://www.kineticist.com/games/pinball/the-shadow.md\"},{\"title\":\"Flat Rate Shipping: $9.99+\",\"url\":\"https://www.marcospecialties.com/pinball-parts/16-2003-101\"},{\"title\":\"The Shadow (pinball)\",\"url\":\"https://en.Wikipedia.com/wiki/The_Shadow_(pinball)\"}]\n\nI didn't find a direct PDF for part number 16-50032-101 in these results.\n\n- **Online manual:** Planetary Pinball hosts a browsable HTML version of The Shadow manual, including a page on upper playfield parts. Mylars can be purchased through your local Bally Distributor.\n- **Complete PDF:** A Pinside forum thread asks for a full PDF because the ones found on ipdb are incomplete, missing pages 2-7 to 2-49 and a couple other random pages. The thread has no confirmed working link, and replies offered a copy by private message.\n- **Physical copy:** An eBay.de listing offers a used 1994 Shadow manual from a seller in the US. The overall condition is described as used but good.\n- **Reseller:** Marcos Specialties sells Bally manuals under the same numbering format, such as #16-50038-101 for The Addams Family Gold. Their Shadow listing didn't come up in this search, so it's worth checking their site directly.\n\nTo find the exact 16-50032-101 PDF, I'd try the Planetary Pinball reference library or the Pinside thread, or search for \"16-50032-101\" on Marcos Specialties.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"0cad21a5-44c8-4838-83a6-be6514964830","timestamp":"2026-11-01T15:01:29.620Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Bally The Shadow pinball manual pdf 16-50032-101","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SX1MnPqjdJskJ5BeQv3q3v","content":[{"title":"Page 140 - The Shadow","url":"https://www.planetarypinball.com/reference/gamemanuals/The_Shadow/files/assets/basic-html/page140.html"},{"title":"the shadow pinball machine","url":"https://vintagearcade.net/shop/pinball-games/the-shadow-pinball-machine/"},{"title":"Page 33 - The Shadow","url":"https://planetarypinball.com/reference/gamemanuals/The_Shadow/files/assets/basic-html/page33.html"},{"title":"ADDAMS GOLD (Bally) Manual operations","url":"https://www.marcospecialties.com:443/pinball-parts/16-50038-101"},{"title":"(Topic ID: 93267)","url":"https://pinside.com/pinball/forum/topic/shadow-manual-pdf"},{"title":"The Shadow Pinball Manual - Bally - 1994-","url":"https://www.ebay.de/itm/126990145325"},{"title":"Page 1 - BallyMidway GREY Parts Catalog 16-9562-A","url":"https://planetarypinball.com/reference/partsmanuals/WMS_Parts_Grey_16-9562-A/files/assets/seo/page1.html"},{"title":"Bally THE GAME SHOW Original Flipper Handbuch mit Schaltplänen Bedienhandbuch-","url":"https://www.ebay.de/itm/267021069057"},{"title":"SCARED STIFF (Bally) Manual - Original","url":"https://www.marcospecialties.com/pinball-parts/16-50048-101"},{"title":"The Shadow Pinball Machine","url":"https://www.vintagearcade.net/?p=9552"},{"title":"Page 3 - BallyMidway GREY Parts Catalog 16-9562-A","url":"https://planetarypinball.com/reference/partsmanuals/WMS_Parts_Grey_16-9562-A/files/assets/seo/page3.html"},{"title":"The Shadow (Bally, 1994) VP9","url":"https://pinballnirvana.com/forums/resources/the-shadow-bally-1994-vp9.2696/"},{"title":"THE GAME SHOW - Pinball Manual - BALLY - OEM Original - Coin Op-","url":"https://www.ebay.de/itm/146278186377"},{"title":"The Shadow","url":"https://pinpedia.com/machine/The-Shadow"},{"title":"The